    "title": "Shelby Co. Sheriff's Office issues B.O.L.O. for missing man on Christmas Eve - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago MEMPHIS, Tenn. — The Shelby County Sheriff's Office (SCSO) has issued a BOLO for a man who went missing on Dec. 22, 2025. Donell T. Roberts was last seen on that day at around 8 p.m. in the area of Macon and Whitten roads on the way to Whitehaven, driving in a White 2017 Nissan Altima with Tennessee tags and damage to the front bumper. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
